# Experiment 2 — an edited generation prompt.
#
# Put your rewritten suggest.md in profiles/overlays/curator-prompt/ first; an
# empty overlay resolves to the shipped prompts, and the report will show both
# variants with the SAME fingerprint, which is the honest way for it to say
# "you have not changed anything yet".
STAGE=suggest
REPS=3
VARIANTS="shipped edited"
VARIANT_shipped_PROFILE=default
VARIANT_edited_PROFILE=curator-prompt
